<title>BULGARIA: BULGARIA CUSTOMS MAKE BIG HEROIN HAUL.</title>
<headline>BULGARIA CUSTOMS MAKE BIG HEROIN HAUL.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgarian customs said on Monday they had seized 29.5 kg (65 lbs) of heroin at the main checkpoint on the border with Turkey. </p>
<p>Customs spokesman Ivan Kutevski said the heroin was found concealed in a Yugoslav-registered car with two Yugoslavs at the Kapitan Andreevo checkpoint.</p>
<p>Bulgaria, which lies on the so-called &quot;Balkan route&quot; for drug trafficking to western Europe, has seized a total of 130.9 kg (288 lbs) of heroin this year.</p>
</text>
